Table 2: Verdicts by paper and by claim. A paper fails if any of its claims fails; failures are split by whose method failed.

| verdict | papers | claims |
|---|---|---|
| reproduces | {{p_reproduces}} | {{c_reproduces}} |
| fails, authors' method | {{t_p_auth}} | {{t_c_auth}} |
| fails, our variant | {{t_p_var}} | {{t_c_var}} |
| fails, our engine | {{t_p_eng}} | {{t_c_eng}} |
| fails, outside the paper's regime | {{t_p_scope}} | {{t_c_scope}} |
